          {
            "claim": "On a balanced replicated 2^3 each requested effect's sum of squares, F and p-value, the residual sum of squares and degrees of freedom, total sum of squares, R^2, adjusted R^2 and fitted values equal an ordinary least-squares fit's (Type III).",
